They were collecting food cans at school.

3
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:10,820
All new and unexpired cans were accepted.

4
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,780
The cans would be delivered to the homeless.

5
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:17,120
The more cans they collected, the better.

6
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,820
Sarah brought 10 cans.

7
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:22,200
Tom brought 5 cans.

8
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,880
Sam brought 13 cans.

9
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:27,480
Everyone else brought cans.

10
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:32,240
In total, the school collected 500 cans.

11
00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:35,080
The food drive was a success.

12
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,960
Everyone was happy to help out.

13
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:41,780
Everyone helped load the cans into the truck.

14
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,880
They also delivered the cans.

15
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:48,540
The food drive was so successful that they

16
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:51,060
decided to do one every month.
